      "writtenOn": "2022-09-13T00:18:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "May want to have this return success or fail and set ProcessState based on it. \ne.g., adapter still presented but stopped and reset through HCI failed.",
      "revId": "b04e6a92c3b0cf304b48f34a0fd559102eaf0ad4",
